rooms_desc ({"You are standing in the main entrance way to Marys house.There are various rooms you can wander round if you like.You can see the following : -StatueLARGE ORCHUGE ORCOrcs MotherOrcs sisterLarge family of orcs chatting awaySmall door matSmall lamp shade round a light","A large bedroom.looking round you see pin stripe wall paper and a large mirror above the bedThis is a very good room Oh Yes !!","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","Yep.. You're in your very own special secret room.Why don't you leave you stuff here when you quit.Theres a big bouncer to guard it all.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Main entrance to Marys house","bedroom","A brand new room, ready to be decorated","Secret room",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
